[TR][TD]🧪 JakesRTP[/TD][TD]1.04[/TD][TD]2 252[/TD][TD]7.5*[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD]🧪 BetterRTP[/TD][TD]1.33[/TD][TD]3 790[/TD][TD]2.18[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD]🧪 HuskHomes[/TD][TD]0.93[/TD][TD]4 939[/TD][TD]2.59[/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]

[B]Folia 1.21.11[/B] — [I]the free build runs on Folia (basic regionized scheduling); these tuned numbers are LeafRTP-Pro's first-class Folia adapter.[/I]
[TABLE]
[TR][TH]Plugin[/TH][TH]TP/s[/TH][TH]Region MSPT p99 (ms)[/TH][TH]Success[/TH][TH]CPU / TP (ms)[/TH][/TR]
[TR][TD][B]🧪 LeafRTP-Pro[/B][/TD][TD][B]9.87[/B][/TD][TD][B]157[/B][/TD][TD][B]99.97 %[/B][/TD][TD][B]18.0[/B][/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD]🧪 BetterRTP[/TD][TD]3.82[/TD][TD]1 200[/TD][TD]100 %[/TD][TD]34.8[/TD][/TR]
[TR][TD]🧪 HuskHomes[/TD][TD]3.32[/TD][TD]901[/TD][TD]100 %[/TD][TD]28.4[/TD][/TR]
[/TABLE]

[B]Architecture support matrix[/B] — [I](Spigot / Paper-and-forks / Folia)[/I]
[LIST]
[*][B]LeafRTP[/B] — ✅🧪 Off-tick Anvil pre-filter · ✅🧪 Fully async via [I]getChunkAtAsync[/I] · ❌ See LeafRTP-Pro
[*][B]LeafRTP-Pro[/B] — ✅🧪 Same as base · ✅🧪 Same as base · ✅🧪 Region Scheduler + off-tick pre-filter, no 1-tick stalls
[*][B]BetterRTP[/B] — ⚠️📖 Sync chunk load on miss · ⚠️📖 No off-tick safety pre-filter · ✅🧪 Folia 1.21.11 functional, p99 ~1.2 s
[*][B]EzRTP[/B] — ❌🧪 [I]NoSuchMethodError[/I] on Spigot 1.20.1 (Paper-only API) · ✅📖 Works on Paper · ❓📖 Not advertised
[*][B]AsyRTP[/B] — ❌🧪 Fails to enable on Spigot 1.20.1 (Paper-only API in [I]onEnable[/I]) · ✅📖 Paper · ✅📖 Folia
[*][B]SorekillRTP[/B] — ⚠️❓ Designed for Redis cross-server, not single-server perf · ⚠️❓ Same · ❓📖
[*][B]AdvancedRTP[/B] — ⚠️📖 Safety-first, sync chunk load · ⚠️📖 Same · ❌📖
[*][B]JakesRTP[/B] — ⚠️📖 Async via flag; 10-slot cache · ✅📖 Same · ❌📖 No Folia
[*][B]EssentialsX /rtp[/B] — ✅📖 Main-thread chunk load per candidate · ✅📖 Same · ❌📖
[*][B]HuskHomes RTP[/B] — ✅📖 Bundled with homes suite · ⚠️📖 Same · ✅🧪 Folia functional, p99 ~900 ms
[/LIST]

[B]Caveats.[/B] 2 clients only (the number is a floor, not a ceiling); hardware, view distance, world state, and other plugins will move them. Paper LeafRTP row reproduced n=2; other rows are n=1 on a single rig. Competitor plugins update frequently — corrections welcome via GitHub issue with a contradicting repro or doc link. Feature breadth, GUI, and claim-integration counts are not benchmarked; several competitors trade speed for those, which is a legitimate design choice.

Full methodology, raw CSVs, per-run analyses: [URL=https://github.com/dailystruggle/RTP/tree/V3/helpers/StressTestRTP][I]helpers/StressTestRTP/[/I][/URL]. Video benchmark of [I]/rtp[/I] on a custom world generator: [URL=https://youtu.be/V0NyNK9JydM]youtu.be/V0NyNK9JydM[/URL].

